<!--
  rcs_ifc.xml : copy of default_ifc.xml with InitialFilterCriteria added to
  route RCS traffic to the OpenRCS Application Servers.

    Presence AS : sip:172.22.0.99:5060  (Presence Server / XDMS / RLS)
    CPM AS      : sip:172.22.0.52:5060  (Converged IP Messaging)

  All added iFC use DefaultHandling 0 (SESSION_CONTINUED) so an AS being down
  does not drop the request. Priorities 21/22/23 are chosen to avoid every
  priority present in default_ifc.xml (10, 11, 20, 25, 30, 40).

  *** REVIEW BEFORE APPLYING - see report handed back with this file. ***
-->
